@char AnAn.Default,ArmR7,ArmL3,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Closed,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@print こいつの意見を聞く方が間違っているな。 { author:AnAn speed:1 waitInput:true Wait:true }

@char Noah.Default,ArmR2,ArmL4,,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Surprised_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Confused_Open,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
